---
description: Laravel 11 PHP conventions for this CRM
globs: "**/*.php"
alwaysApply: false
---

- PHP 8.2+ and Laravel 11. Use php artisan make:* for PHP classes.
- Migrations are the only schema changes. Index foreign keys and lookup columns.
- Eager load every relationship a page displays. Paginate lists at 25, max 200.
- Form Requests for validation. Policies for authorization. Actions in app/Actions for writes.
- Route model binding on detail routes.
- config() in application code. Secrets only in .env.
- Password hashes use bcrypt. Login lockout is 5 failures. Session lifetime is 120 minutes. (Do not implement the lockout/history extras in Stage 0; Breeze defaults are enough. These rules are for later stages.)
